{"id":"nae224642c9","headline":"Trump admin promotes new $103K fee for skilled worker visa","summary":"The Trump administration on Monday moved to introduce a fee of over $100,000 on employers hiring foreign workers through a high-skilled visa program. Details of implementation were not provided in the candidate report.","why":"The H-1B program lets US employers hire skilled foreign workers, mainly in technology, so changes to its cost directly affect hiring plans and labor expenses for those companies.","category":"economy","event_type":"labor","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Washington, D.C.","country":"United States of America","lat":38.9,"lon":-77.04,"region":"na"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Daily Sabah","url":"https://www.dailysabah.com/business/economy/trump-admin-promotes-new-103k-fee-for-skilled-worker-visa"},"sources":[{"name":"Daily Sabah","url":"https://www.dailysabah.com/business/economy/trump-admin-promotes-new-103k-fee-for-skilled-worker-visa"}],"published_at":"2026-08-24T19:59:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T00:21:16Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"f827b58cb2e75c9c","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T00:21:16Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-08-24T19:59:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-08-25T00:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"CH","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/office-meeting-7978588.jpg","alt":"office meeting (illustration)","credit":"jhenning","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/laptop-conference-table-mouse-work-7978588/"}}